{"title":"Cyprus Seniors Team Selection Tests","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Cyprus Seniors Team Selection Tests</b> are considered the four parts of the <b>Selection Competition above 15.5</b> and are called <i>\"Michael Georgallas\"</i>. All the students have the same test. In each of the competition five students are eliminated. So after the fourth test the six members of the national team for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"International Mathematical Olympiad\">IMO</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">BMO</a> and the four runners-up are selected.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Team_Selection_Tests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_TST_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors TST Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Seniors TST Problems and Solutions</a> -- A community effort to provide solutions to all Cyprus Seniors TST problems from which students can learn.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Team_Selection_Tests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Cyprus mathematics competitions\">Cyprus mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018082059\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: 